{
  "bookId": "rewind-45",
  "id": "chapter-181",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "37501001",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "潮酷街区，边界咖啡馆。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37501002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小乔",
          "text": "夜班的时候出来吹吹风也挺惬意的呢……你不用「巡夜」吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37501003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "星洛和波波去露营了，店长让我留下来看着咖啡馆。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37501004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "……招牌，歪掉了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37501005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小乔",
          "text": "大概是昨日刮过大风的缘故，今日终于不堪重负了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37501006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "现在向下偏移了25度，复原后可以采取一些加固措施。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37501007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37501008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "……嗯？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37501009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小乔",
          "text": "你也察觉了吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37501010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "帕拉斯检测到了50米外的高空运动轨迹。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37501011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小乔",
          "text": "有些可惜，现在的话已经追不上了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37501012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小乔",
          "text": "那便是红眼的……天使吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37531001",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "翌日，爱猫社区。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37531002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "……用缩小的身体四处奔走，可真是麻烦呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37531003",
          "sourceType": 7,
          "text": "仲村百合 · 战线的领导者\n商品名称：仲村百合·战线的领导者Ver.\n作品出处：《Angel Beats!》\n制造商：SNOW.A 细雪庭\n手办材质：ABS&PVC 涂装完成\n手办规格：1/7比例模型·附专用底座・全高约230mm",
          "title": "角色介绍卡",
          "type": "profile"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37531004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "立华奏",
          "text": "没关系，百合。我们可以慢慢找。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37531005",
          "sourceType": 7,
          "text": "立华奏 · 天使学生会长\n商品名称：立华奏·天使学生会长Ver.\n作品出处：《Angel Beats!》\n制造商：TENMA 天马\n手办材质：ABS&PVC 涂装完成\n手办规格：1/7比例模型·附专用底座・全高约225mm",
          "title": "角色介绍卡",
          "type": "profile"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37531006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "希望Angel Player的丢失不会引发什么奇怪的事件。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37531007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "等下。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37531008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "……小心，前面的人有点可疑。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37531009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "管理局员工",
          "text": "你好，请问你就是立华奏小姐，是吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37531010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "立华奏",
          "text": "嗯，我是。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37531011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "管理局员工",
          "text": "各位，准备。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37531012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "喂，你们要干什么？离小奏远一点！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37531013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "管理局员工",
          "text": "我们是M城管理局的工作人员。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37531014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "管理局员工",
          "text": "现在怀疑立华奏涉嫌多起管理局员工伤害案件，以及FULI设施破坏案件。请配合我们的调查。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37531015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "胡说什么呢？她明明一直和我待在一起。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37531016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "管理局员工",
          "text": "你有证据可以证实这一点吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37531017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "哈？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37531018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "管理局员工",
          "text": "请放心，管理局不会冤枉任何遵纪守法的手办。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37531019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "……只是这些人的话我能对付。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37531020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "立华奏",
          "text": "没事的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37531021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "小奏？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37531022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "立华奏",
          "text": "我可以配合调查。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37531023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "立华奏",
          "text": "但是你们不可以伤害我的同伴。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37531024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "管理局员工",
          "text": "感谢理解，我们也只是执行公务。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37531025",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "立华奏",
          "text": "我会保护好自己的，百合。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37531026",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37531027",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "管理局员工",
          "text": "请跟我们走吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37531028",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "……",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37531029",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "这个距离应该不会被发现……该跟上去了。",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37531030",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "啊，我当然也会调查这件事的。",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37531031",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "但是，会是「战线」的做法。",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-907",
