      "title": "新世界战线·Ⅲ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "37504001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "……啊。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37504002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "这里……是哪里？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37504003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "你终于醒了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37504004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "请问你是……？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37504005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "立华奏",
          "text": "立华奏。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37504006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "呜哇，这对翅膀……就像是天使。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37504007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "立华奏",
          "text": "其实我不是什么天使。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37504008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "抱歉，刚才不小心说出口了。我是仓田家的真乃，叫我真乃就可以啦。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37504009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "周围都是光秃秃的墙壁，这里给人的感觉就像是……牢房？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37504010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "立华奏",
          "text": "把我带到这里的人说，这是这个设施最深处的房间。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37504011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "也就是伊迪丝女士说的……「最安全的地方」？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37504012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "啊哈哈哈……但看上去不光别人进不来，我们也出不去呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37504013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "立华奏",
          "text": "好困，我要睡了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37504014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "欸？等下，我们要一直被关在这里吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37504015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "立华奏",
          "text": "现在待在这里也是没有办法的事。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37504016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "立华奏",
          "text": "哈啊……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37504017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "立华奏",
          "text": "晚安。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37504018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "居然就这样睡着了，好可爱……不对，啊啊啊，这到底是怎么回事……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37504019",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "另一边，临时会议室——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37504020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "卡缪",
          "text": "……这就是神的光辉。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37504021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "卡缪",
          "text": "哼，能够窥探到这份力量，是你们的荣幸。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37504022",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "小乔",
          "text": "很厉害，会是行动的一大助力。而且只要适当引导，他便不会做出格之事。",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37504023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "好的，谢谢你的时间，请回去等通知吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37504024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小乔",
          "text": "（悄悄话）为什么？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37504025",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "嘛，这说话方式，让我想起了一个非常讨厌的人。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37504026",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "下一位。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37504027",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蔡文姬",
          "text": "……你们好，我是蔡琰，粗懂一些音律。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37504028",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蔡文姬",
          "text": "我相信立华小姐，善良的她绝不会是近期的恶性事件的犯人。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37504029",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蔡文姬",
          "text": "所以，我想为她做一些力所能及的事。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37504030",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "啊，你不就是我们之前遇到过的，被混混手办缠上的女孩吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37504031",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蔡文姬",
          "text": "嗯，又见面了，仲村小姐。我是来报恩的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37504032",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "回想起来，那还是我和小奏在这个世界第一次联手战斗呢……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37504033",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "就是在那场战斗里，小奏使用了「和声」吗？",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37601001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蔡文姬",
          "text": "……胡笳声寒，却情深义重。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37601002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小乔",
          "text": "是啊，闭上眼，便能感受到边塞的凄美。天地悠然旷远，却仍不及家乡之景。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37601003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "糟糕，不知道为什么，有点想流眼泪……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37601004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "你通过了，欢迎加入新世界战线。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37601005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蔡文姬",
          "text": "非常感谢，我会努力的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37601006",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "小乔",
          "text": "呼，稍微安心了一点。",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37601007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊达政宗",
          "text": "……来自政宗事务所，hold on正义的事务；\n胜利最终属于我，dear friends务必要记住♫",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37601008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊达政宗",
          "text": "Just done上一场表演，向观众致谢；\nMy trip下一个地点，战线新世界♫",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37601009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "政宗事务所的伊达政宗……？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37601010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊达政宗",
          "text": "Yeah♫现在的时间，only one rapper在不务正业♫",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37601011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小乔",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37601012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "Rap的话肢体动作可以再丰富一点，但是并不坏呢~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37601013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "好，现在「主力部队」和「佯攻部队」的人员已经到位了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37601014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "可以开始下一步了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
